# Optional, server-only HTTPS RPC for reading public SOL balances on Solana mainnet.
# The public endpoint below is also the default when this variable is unset.
# Custom providers must support JSON-RPC batches and pass the mainnet genesis check.
# Copy to .env.local for local configuration; keep provider credentials there or in
# your deployment's secret settings. Never rename this to NEXT_PUBLIC_SOLANA_RPC_URL.
SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
